=== TC-OTA-22: E401 (second OTA while one is running) ===
DUT on v2.3.0, server `ota_server.py --slow 20` (download ~20 s on this network).
> ota url http://192.168.50.28:8000/fw7/v2.3.0/sentry_fw7.bin
[OTA] downloading ...   W409 same version v2.3.0 - reinstalling
[OTA] 10% ... 100%
Console did not accept any input while the download was running (a second command was typed, nothing
was processed until the end). After the download:
[OTA] success: v2.3.0 -> v2.3.0 in 20 s. Rebooting...
boot: Loaded app from partition at offset 0x1a0000 (ota_1)
[OTA] running v2.3.0 from ota_1
W [OTA] new firmware, PENDING_VERIFY - self-check...
I [OTA] self-check passed, firmware marked VALID
Result: N/A - E401 cannot be triggered from the console, OTA blocks command input (accepted as expected). (Same-version
reinstall via `ota url` completed, switched ota_0 -> ota_1 and passed the self-check: extra OTA-6 evidence.)

