=== TC-OTA-25: ota check without network ===
(a) Wi-Fi fully off:
> ota check
E002 Wi-Fi required. Use 'reconnect' or 'connect'
Result (a): PASS per AC-1b ([wifi] commands give E002 without Wi-Fi). E411 is a different case: Wi-Fi up, no internet.
(b) E411 with Wi-Fi up but WAN disconnected: not tested yet.

(b) Wi-Fi connected (iPhone hotspot, rssi -32), mobile data on the phone switched off (no internet):
> ota check
E esp-tls: [sock=54] select() timeout
E HTTP_CLIENT: Connection failed, sock < 0
E402 cannot reach OTA server (stable.txt)
Result (b): E402, not E411 as the PRD wording suggests ("E411 no internet"). E411 was not observed in any scenario
(see OBS-06 in bugs/Improvements.md). Not filed as a bug: E402 also fits "server unreachable".
